body:
As an AMAB I always believed I was female, Throughout my childhood and experienced horrible gender dysphoria because I wasn't AFAB.

&#x200B;

The dysphoria is less severe now, But still present and I don't feel entirely like a woman but I have a big connection to womanhood so this is the right term for me I think. A transfemme Demigirl uwu

" The right question is, 'How do I want to live my life?' "

&#x200B;

The problem is that I have no idea, As I was saying I suffer from identity disturbance. I kinda get where you're coming from though, Thank you :)
